vpn-no-killswitch-title = The VPN has no kill switch
vpn-no-killswitch-summary = If the tunnel drops, this computer keeps sending traffic outside it, in the open. A kill switch blocks everything except the tunnel until it is back.
vpn-dns-title = The VPN and the secure DNS both want to answer DNS
vpn-dns-summary = The VPN profile sets its own DNS servers while secure DNS is on, so some names may be asked of the VPN's resolver instead.
vpn-blocked-title = The tunnel is down and the kill switch is blocking traffic
vpn-blocked-summary = Nothing leaves this computer except to the VPN server. Bring the VPN up, or undo the kill switch in History.
vpn-may-affect-network = Traffic outside the tunnel is blocked while the kill switch is on.
vpn-may-affect-lan = Printers and other devices on your local network stop answering unless you allow their addresses.
